   "summary": "In a statement signed by Mallam Bala Nasir, the civil rights group said Governor Usman Ododo’s action has punctured allegations that the ruling party instructed its governors to deny opposition parties access to public facilities for rallies. The group maintained that the development clears President Bola Ahmed Tinubu of opposition claims that he masterminded a plot to stifle political opposition.",
   "summary_zh": "在一份由马利姆·巴拉·纳西尔签署的声明中，公民权利组织表示，州长乌斯曼·奥多多的行动驳斥了有关执政党指示其州长拒绝反对党使用公共设施举行集会的指控。该组织坚持认为，此举洗清了总统博拉·艾哈迈德·蒂努布策划压制政治反对派的指责。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "In a statement signed by Mallam Bala Nasir, the civil rights group said Governor Usman Ododo’s action has punctured allegations that the ruling party instructed its governors to deny opposition parties access to public facilities for rallies. The group maintained that the development clears President Bola Ahmed Tinubu of opposition claims that he masterminded a plot to stifle political opposition. Describing Governor Ododo as an asset to the All Progressives Congress (APC), the FDA urged other governors to emulate his approach, noting that granting venues to opponents does not translate to losing an election, but rather strengthens democratic norms. The foundation also charged the opposition to reciprocate the governor’s political tolerance by ensuring peaceful campaigns and reining in supporters to prevent lawlessness. Lauding Ododo as a patriotic leader, the FDA warned politicians against making inflammatory remarks capable of disrupting the peaceful coexistence of Kogi residents. It noted that the governor’s leadership has changed the state’s public image for the better since he assumed office. Furthermore, the group praised Ododo for his proactive stance on security, acknowledging Kogi’s strategic geographic location and the necessity of sustained investments in public safety. It urged the governor to remain focused on maintaining peace across the state. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
