   "title": "Samajwadi Party, Congress form 4-member panels each for seat-sharing talks in the run-up to UP polls",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/samajwadi-party-congress-form-4-member-panels-each-for-seat-sharing-talks-in-the-run-up-to-up-polls-101795366367630.html",
   "domain": "hindustantimes.com",
