   "title": "Asikuma Inland Port to ease Tema Port congestion and create jobs in Asuogyaman",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/asikuma-inland-port-to-ease-tema-port-congestion-and-create-jobs-in-asuogyaman-mahama/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
